  "summary": {
    "value": "Index-Echo-S2ST-9B translates a Chinese or English speech clip into another language and generates speech conditioned on the source speaker's voice. It combines a frozen Index-Echo-S2TT-9B backbone, a learned Hidden2CV mapper, and CosyVoice3 speech generation in one self-contained package and Python process.",
